{
  "$schema": "../../templates/libs-catalog.schema.json",
  "stackId": "kotlin-junit",
  "category": "qa",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "buildSystem": "gradle",
  "manifest": {
    "files": [
      "workspace/src/{BackendName}/build.gradle.kts",
      "workspace/src/{BackendName}/gradle/libs.versions.toml"
    ],
    "versionCatalogPath": "gradle/libs.versions.toml"
  },
  "versions": {
    "junit-jupiter": "5.14.2",
    "kotlin-test": "2.0.21",
    "mockk": "1.14.11",
    "spring-boot-test": "3.5.16",
    "spring-security-test": "6.5.11",
    "kotest-assertions": "5.9.1",
    "testcontainers": "1.21.4"
  },
  "core": [
    {
      "module": "org.junit.jupiter:junit-jupiter",
      "ref": "junit-jupiter"
    },
    {
      "module": "org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-test-junit5",
      "ref": "kotlin-test"
    },
    {
      "module": "io.mockk:mockk",
      "ref": "mockk"
    }
  ],
  "onDemand": [
    {
      "module": "org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-test",
      "ref": "spring-boot-test",
      "capability": "spring-test",
      "triggers": [
        "spring",
        "MockMvc",
        "WebTestClient"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "org.springframework.security:spring-security-test",
      "ref": "spring-security-test",
      "capability": "spring-security-test",
      "triggers": [
        "WithMockUser",
        "spring.*security",
        "auth.*test"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "io.kotest:kotest-assertions-core",
      "ref": "kotest-assertions",
      "capability": "fluent-assertions",
      "triggers": [
        "kotest",
        "shouldBe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "org.testcontainers:postgresql",
      "ref": "testcontainers",
      "capability": "testcontainers",
      "triggers": [
        "testcontainers",
        "docker.*test",
        "postgresql.*test"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "plugins": [
    {
      "id": "jacoco",
      "version": "built-in-gradle"
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "lastUpdated": "2026-09-02",
    "format": "compact (v2)",
    "changeLog": [
      "2026-09-02 — Audit QA. Ce catalog etait desynchronise de son .md : la section 2.4 generee affichait `spring-boot-starter-test:4.0.6` alors que le catalog pinnait 3.3.5 — vestige d'un bump vers Spring Boot 4 applique puis revert, dont le .md n'avait pas ete regenere. COHERENCE DE LIGNE : ce stack QA doit suivre la majeure de ses consommateurs (backend/kotlin-spring-boot et fullstack/kotlin-mustache, tous deux en Spring Boot 3.5.16). D'ou `spring-boot-test: 3.5.16` et `spring-security-test: 6.5.11` — la ligne 7.x de Spring Security accompagne Spring Boot 4, pas 3. JUnit reste sur la ligne 5 (5.14.2) : la 6.1.3 est publiee mais c'est une majeure, et Spring Boot 3.5 embarque JUnit 5 dans son BOM. Kotest reste en 5.9.1 pour la meme raison (la 6.x est une majeure)."
    ]
  }
}
